{"articleNo":"201510","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=201510&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"★ 학생 본인의 학적부 기재사항 정비 요청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.12.10","hit":"4174","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: #0075c8\">학생 본인의 학적부 기재사항 정비 요청</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">​</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학적부 학적기재사항 미기재사항을&nbsp;확인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">후 정정 바랍니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">★ 사진등재 :&nbsp; 사진 미등재시 수강신청할 수 없습니다. </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">★ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">영문성명... 없을경우 영문증명서 발급 되지 않습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">★ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">본인 주소 및 연락처 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;:&nbsp; 주소불명, 전화번호 오류등</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">으로 인하여</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학생에게 전달될 중요한&nbsp;사항들을 받지 못하여</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;본인의 학사관리에 불이익이 생길수 있으므로 </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">반드시 변경자는 학적부 기재사항을 수정하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">​</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; [ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스 - 학적부 - 기재사항변경&nbsp;&nbsp;]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">​</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">​</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
